      "en": "Then Hezekiah turned his face to the wall and prayed to the LORD,",
      "ko": "히스기야가 얼굴을 벽으로 향하고 여호와께 기도하여",
      "source_text_hash": "39d6120db55dbe8e088d1f0774b6a414549ca0f6dd8a94ec1d04d744320e90dd",
      "translation_text_hash": "04a1d55f79618b9de9f0b25651864b88f24961387e48c0e7e2fb6e8bbdf38584",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "히스기야가 얼굴을 벽으로 향하고 여호와께 기도하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "04a1d55f79618b9de9f0b25651864b88f24961387e48c0e7e2fb6e8bbdf38584"
      ]
