      "en": "What will I say? He has both spoken to me, and himself has done it. I will walk carefully all my years because of the anguish of my soul.",
      "ko": "주께서 내게 말씀하시고 또 친히 이루셨사오니 내가 무슨 말씀을 하오리이까 내 영혼의 고통을 인하여 내가 종신토록 각근히 행하리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "4d28761fbeacc73949aba8b1c1f41bf8603924f195b379339a98e7a232a1d7b8",
